  },
  "solutions": [
    {
      "id": "sol.ahsme-1952-p4.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "The first pound costs \\(10\\) cents. The remaining \\(P-1\\) pounds cost \\(3(P-1)\\) cents, so \\[ C=10+3(P-1). \\]\n\nThus, the correct answer is C.",
      "hints": [
        "Only the pounds after the first are charged at the additional-pound rate",
        "A \\(P\\)-pound package has \\(P-1\\) additional pounds"
